RWKV-7 clampw_v3 CUDA kernel

The files rwkv7_clampw_v3.cpp and rwkv7_clampw_v3_for_h100_alt.cu in this
directory are adapted from:
  https://github.com/BlinkDL/RWKV-LM/tree/main/RWKV-v7/train_temp/cuda

Upstream project:
  BlinkDL/RWKV-LM

Upstream commit tested locally:
  f3a67cacc585ba86d11d0e345358405fae550225

License:
  Apache License 2.0

Local changes:
  - Rename the TORCH_LIBRARY namespace from rwkv7_clampw_v3 to
    rwkvasr_rwkv7_clampw_v3 to avoid extension-registration collisions.
  - Use the upstream *_for_h100_alt CUDA source because it compiles on RTX
    4090 / sm_89 and uses fewer forward registers than the non-alt variant
    in local compile output.
  - Keep the upstream kernel interface and compile-time _N_ / _CHUNK_LEN_
    contract unchanged.
